      "updated": 1788167776312,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "                        POUIC'S STATE\nHappiness: Leave player or commit suicide if too low\nHealth: Die if 0\nAge: Die when too old\nStress: Can breed if stress is low\nStats: Stat will be added according to future needs\nJob: jobs will be added according to future needs\nBrain: Q-Table\nTraits: traits are random attributes which influence the pouic's\nbehavior (ex: a superticious pouic cannot suicide but have a high\nstress)\n\n                        POUIC'S BEHAVIOR\n\nBreed\nLeave\nCommit suicide",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "                        POUIC'S STATE\nHappiness: Leave player or commit suicide if too low\nHealth: Die if 0\nAge: Die when too old\nStress: Can breed if stress is low\nStats: Stat will be added according to future needs\nJob: jobs will be added according to future needs\nBrain: Q-Table\nTraits: traits are random attributes which influence the pouic's\nbehavior (ex: a superticious pouic cannot suicide but have a high\nstress)\n\n                        POUIC'S BEHAVIOR\n\nBreed\nLeave\nCommit suicide",
